                                             "title":  "PowderRunbook",
                                             "subtitle":  "Powder coating job tracker",
                                             "description":  "PowderRunbook is an offline shop-floor runbook for small powder-coating teams. Keep each job\u0027s prep, powder lot, cure record, thickness check and QC notes together without moving your workflow into a full ERP.\n\nBUILT AROUND THE REAL SHOP FLOW\nMove work through Prep, Mask, Coat, Cure, QC and Done. Every job keeps its customer, part, quantity, substrate and operator notes in one place.\n\nTRACE POWDER LOTS\nRecord brand, color, code, lot number, storage location and starting weight. Logged job usage gives you a practical on-device remaining-weight estimate.\n\nRECORD CURE VALUES\nKeep the target temperature and time beside the values actually recorded for the job. PowderRunbook stores the record; it does not decide whether a cure schedule is compliant.\n\nKEEP THICKNESS \u0026 QC TOGETHER\nStore target and measured film thickness, QC status and final notes with the job record.\n\nSEE THE FLOOR AT A GLANCE\nThe overview shows active work, recently completed jobs and recorded powder usage without a cloud dashboard.\n\nPRIVATE BY DESIGN\nNo account, ads, analytics or cloud upload. Workshop records stay on the device unless you choose to share or move them yourself.\n\nPowderRunbook is a recordkeeping aid, not a process certification system. Always follow the powder manufacturer\u0027s technical data sheet, pretreatment requirements, calibrated equipment procedures and workplace safety rules.",
